{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: The current version is still in Alpha testing stage. You have obtained a game DEMO, which does not represent the final game quality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u200b<strong>\u200b</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;RPG Progression \u00d7 Card Strategy \u00d7 Retro Pixel \u00d7 RogueLite&quot;\u200b</i></strong>\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Origin: A Post-War Haven for Rabbitkind]\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Twenty years ago, the war between humans and rabbitkind ended in devastating defeat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The surviving rabbits fled to a nameless, abandoned island\u2014forging their last refuge in the ruins: Bonny Town.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath its tranquil surface lie unhealed wounds... and whispers of conspiracy.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Your Role: The Mysterious Outsider]\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a scarred wanderer, a rabbit with no past, stepping onto this secluded shore.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No one knows your history\u2014here, you rewrite your fate!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Core Gameplay: A Dance with Danger]\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b\u25c6 Explore a Shifting World\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into unpredictable forests, caves, and dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources, hunt beasts, and master <i>grid-based survival inventory</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b\u25c6 Card-Strategy Combat\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>turn-based battles</i>, steal enemy abilities, seal foes, or summon allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse <i>gear + skills + monster cards</i>to craft your ultimate deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b\u25c6 Trials of Hunger &amp; Death\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time drains stamina... <i>lose all progress</i>if your adventure ends in failure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[<i>Bonny Town</i>: Your Cozy Corner of Chaos]\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b\u25c7 Own a Hideout\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your <i>private sanctuary</i>in a world of turmoil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b\u25c7 Befriend the Locals\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help villagers achieve their dreams\u2014or become part of <i>their</i>story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b\u25c7 Uncover Secrets\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From eerie island ruins to <i>the truth of fallen gods</i>...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950980?t=1760000364","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950980/8d64e4e38e5decc3b0ff24ba43d6a544db9a2e55/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760000364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950980/f076fd3146a37ead9c2dbca3ddb9070e895892cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760000364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950980/f076fd3146a37ead9c2dbca3ddb9070e895892cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760000364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: The current version is still in Alpha testing stage. You have obtained a game DEMO, which does 